<title>BOSNIA: Bosnia Jan retail prices rise 3.8 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Bosnia Jan retail prices rise 3.8 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Bureau of Bosnia's Moslem-Croat federation issued the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p> BOSNIA RETAIL PRICES    JAN 97  DEC 96  JAN 96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)    +3.8    +0.4    N/A</p>
<p> Year-on-year change     +9.4    +7.7    N/A</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data cover 51 percent of Bosnia-Hercegovina territory. Data for remaining 49 percent are not available.</p>
<p>January 1997 retail prices rose 4.8 percent compared with average 1996 retail prices, the office said. -- Sarajevo newsroom, +387-71-663-864</p>
</text>
